  <div class="learn-intros">
    <article id="staffing-guide"><h2>What is offshore staffing?</h2><p>A dedicated employee works from another country as part of your business. You choose the person, set their priorities and manage their daily work. With iHire’s managed model, recruitment, employment administration and agreed infrastructure are handled around that employee.</p><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works/">Explore the staffing process →</a></article>
    <article id="staffing-vs-outsourcing"><h2>Staffing or outsourcing?</h2><p>In the iHire staffing model, you lead the person and their work. In a task-based outsourcing arrangement, a supplier typically takes responsibility for delivering a defined service or output. Start by deciding whether you need a team member to manage or a supplier to deliver a service.</p><a class="text-link" href="/hire-talent/">Understand the iHire model →</a></article>
